                                                "sense_id": "513286ef-9d31-37f4-b4a6-bb99bc92b65d",
                                                "text": "Opposite the almshouses is the bow-fronted post office and shop, while near by, beneath the trees on the green, is the old whipping post and stocks, the latter pierced by five holes."
                                            },
                                            {
